I'm not a member of the devteam, but I'll throw in my tuppence
anyway :-)  First off, you only get curses as standard on Unix,
and even then, it varies widely from machine to machine.  I 
believe BSD curses doesn't have colour support (has this changed
in 4.4?).

Second, I don't see how it's going to be any faster, since it's a
level above the raw terminfo stuff.  I assume it uses the terminfo/
termcap/termlib stuff on Unix - I don't know how it's done on other
OS's.  Easier maybe, faster - I doubt it.

